## BCP 47 language subtags and the OpenType language system tags they map
## to, as HarfBuzz 14.6.0 maps them (`hb-ot-tag-table.hh`, generated there
## from the IANA language subtag registry and the OpenType language tag
## registry). Each table is a string of fixed-size records of four-byte
## tags; a language subtag is padded with spaces.
##
## Internal data for `ShaperTags`. Each table is sorted by its language
## subtag (`ShaperTagsTests` checks it), so lookups are binary searches.
ShaperLanguages :: {}.{

	## Two-letter subtags: records of subtag and tag (8 bytes), a subtag
	## listed once per tag it maps to, in order of preference.
	two : List(U8)
	two = "aa  AFR ab  ABK af  AFK ak  AKA am  AMH an  ARG ar  ARA as  ASM av  AVR ay  AYM az  AZE ba  BSH be  BEL bg  BGR bi  BIS bi  CPP bm  BMB bn  BEN bo  TIB br  BRE bs  BOS ca  CAT ce  CHE ch  CHA co  COS cr  CRE cs  CSY cu  CSL cv  CHU cy  WEL da  DAN de  DEU dv  DIV dv  DHV dz  DZN ee  EWE el  ELL en  ENG eo  NTO es  ESP et  ETI eu  EUQ fa  FAR ff  FUL fi  FIN fj  FJI fo  FOS fr  FRA fy  FRI ga  IRI ga  IRT gd  GAE gl  GAL gn  GUA gu  GUJ gv  MNX ha  HAU he  IWR hi  HIN ho  HMO ho  CPP hr  HRV ht  HAI ht  CPP hu  HUN hy  HYE0hy  HYE hz  HER ia  INA id  IND id  MLY ie  ILE ig  IBO ii  YIM ik  IPK in  IND in  MLY io  IDO is  ISL it  ITA iu  INU iu  INUKiw  IWR ja  JAN ji  JII jv  JAV jw  JAV ka  KAT kg  KON0ki  KIK kj  KUA kk  KAZ kl  GRN km  KHM kn  KAN ko  KOR ko  KOH kr  KNR ks  KSH ku  KUR kv  KOM kw  COR ky  KIR la  LAT lb  LTZ lg  LUG li  LIM ln  LIN lo  LAO lt  LTH lu  LUB lv  LVI mg  MLG mh  MAH mi  MRI mk  MKD ml  MAL ml  MLR mn  MNG mo  MOL mo  ROM mr  MAR ms  MLY mt  MTS my  BRM na  NAU nb  NOR nd  NDB ne  NEP ng  NDG nl  NLD nn  NYN no  NOR nr  NDB nv  NAV nv  ATH ny  CHI oc  OCI oj  OJB om  ORO or  ORI os  OSS pa  PAN pi  PAL pl  PLK ps  PAS pt  PTG qu  QUZ rm  RMS rn  RUN ro  ROM ru  RUS rw  RUA sa  SAN sc  SRD sd  SND se  NSM sg  SGO sh  BOS sh  HRV sh  SRB si  SNH sk  SKY sl  SLV sm  SMO sn  SNA0so  SML sq  SQI sr  SRB ss  SWZ st  SOT su  SUN sv  SVE sw  SWK ta  TAM te  TEL tg  TAJ th  THA ti  TGY tk  TKM tl  TGL tn  TNA to  TGN tr  TRK ts  TSG tt  TAT tw  TWI tw  AKA ty  THT ug  UYG uk  UKR ur  URD uz  UZB ve  VEN vi  VIT vo  VOL wa  WLN wo  WLF xh  XHS yi  JII yo  YBA za  ZHA zh  ZHS zu  ZUL ".to_utf8()

	## Three-letter subtags with one tag: records of subtag and tag (8
	## bytes).
	three : List(U8)
	three = "aae SQI aao ARA aat SQI abh ARA abq ABA abs CPP abv ARA acm ARA acq ARA acw ARA acx ARA ada DNG adf ARA adp DZN aeb ARA aec ARA afb ARA afs CPP agu MYN ahg AGW aht ATH aig CPP aiw ARI ajp ARA ajt ARA aln SQI als SQI amf HBN amw SYR aoa CPP apa ATH apc ARA apd ARA apj ATH apk ATH apl ATH apm ATH apw ATH arb ARA arn MAP arq ARA ars ARA arz ARA atj RCR atv ALT auj BBR auz ARA avl ARA ayc AYM ayh ARA ayl ARA ayn ARA ayp ARA ayr AYM azd NAH azj AZE azn NAH azz NAH bad BAD0bah CPP bai BML bal BLI bbj BML bbp BAD0bbz ARA bcc BLI bci BAU bcl BIK bcq BCH bcr ATH bea ATH beb BTI ber BBR bew CPP bfl BAD0bfq BAD bft BLT bfu LAH bfy BAG bgn BLI bgp BLI bgr QIN bhb BHI bhk BIK bhr MLG bin EDO biu QIN bjn MLY bjo BAD0bjq MLG bjs CPP bjt BLN bko BML bla BKF ble BLN blg IBA bln BIK bmm MLG bpd BAD0bpl CPP bpq CPP bqi LRC bqk BAD0bra BRI brc CPP btb BTI btj MLY bto BIK bum BTI bve MLY bvu MLY bwe KRN bxk LUH bxo CPP bxp BTI bxr RBU byn BIL bzc MLG bzj CPP bzk CPP caa MYN cac MYN cbl QIN ccl CPP ccm CPP cco CCHNccq ARK cdo ZHS cek QIN cey QIN chf MYN chj CCHNchk CHK0chn CPP chq CCHNchz CCHNciw OJB cjy ZHS cka QIN ckb KUR ckn QIN cks CPP ckt CHK ckz MYN clc ATH cld SYR cle CCHNclj QIN cls SAN clt QIN cmn ZHS cmr QIN cnb QIN cnh QIN cnk QIN cnl CCHNcnp ZHS cnr SRB cnt CCHNcnu BBR cnw QIN coa MLY cob MYN coq ATH cpa CCHNcpe CPP cpf CPP cpi CPP cpx ZHS cqd HMN crh CRT cri CPP crp CPP crs CPP csa CCHNcsh QIN csj QIN cso CCHNcsp ZHS csv QIN csy QIN ctc ATH ctd QIN cte CCHNcth QIN ctl CCHNcts BIK ctu MYN cuc CCHNcvn CCHNczh ZHS czo ZHS czt QIN dao QIN dap NIS dcr CPP dep CPP dgr ATH dhd MAW dib DNK dik DNK din DNK dip DNK diw DNK dje DJR djk CPP djr DJR0dks DNK dng DUN doi DGR drh MNG dsb LSB dty NEP dup MLY dwk KUI dwu DUJ dwy DUJ dyu JUL ekk ETI eky KRN emy MYN enb KAL enf FNE enh TNE esg GON esi IPK esk IPK eto BTI eve EVN evn EVK ewo BTI eyo KAL fab CPP fbl BIK ffm FUL fil PIL fng CPP fpe CPP fub FUL fuc FUL fue FUL fuh FUL fui FUL fuq FUL fur FRL gaa GAD gac CPP gan ZHS gax OR