	blocked = "aba afk agw ari ark bag bau bbr bch bil bkf bli blt bmb bml bri brm bsh bti chg chh crr crt csl dhv dnk dri dun dzn ecr euq far fos gad gae gal gar gaw gmz gro gua hal hbn iri ism jan jii jud jul kac keb kge khn khs khv kis kkn klm kmn kmo kms knr kod koh kop koz kpl krk krm krn ksi ksm kui kul kuy kyk lah lak lam laz ldk lma lmb lmw lsb lth lvi maj map maw mbn mch mcr mde miz mkr mle mln mlr mnd mng mnx mok mor mth mts mun nas ncr ndb ndg ngr nis nko nsm nto oro paa pal pas pil plk rms sad say sgo sib sig sks sky sla sml snh sog srb srk ssl ssm sur sve swk taj tgn tgr tgy tkm tmn tna tne tng trk tsg tua tul tuv vit wag xbd yak yba yim znd ".to_utf8()
